== UtaiteUnitMember template ==
__notoc__
The '''UtaiteUnitMember''' template displays the member roster of an utaite unit as a card grid. One transclusion renders '''all''' members via numbered parameters — no more stacking one transclusion per member inside a manual flex <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>.

Rendering is handled by [[Module:UtaiteUnitMember]]; styling lives in [[Template:UtaiteUnitMember/styles.css]] (all classes prefixed <code>uum-</code>).
<tabber>Usage=
=== Usage ===

Use the following syntax. Number each member's parameters consecutively (<code>1, 2, 3, …</code>) — the module stops at the first missing <code>name#</code>, so a gap in the numbering ends the list.

<pre>
{{UtaiteUnitMember
|variant=
|image1=
|name1=
|color1=
|desc1=
|fanname1=
|oshimark1=
|status1=
|leader1= yes (ONLY ADD THIS PARAMETER IF HE/SHE/THEY ARE A LEADER)
|image2=
|name2=
...
}}
</pre>

